  17:     Swap each bordered square's colors and grow original-border-colored rectangles from its four sides.
  18: 
  19:     Input structure:
  20:     - The grid contains one or two separated square patterns on a black background.
  21:     - Each pattern has a solid inner square and a one-pixel outer border in a different color.
  22:     - There is enough surrounding black space for the pattern to grow outward.
  23: 
  24:     Rule:
